  "name": "pan-foreman",
  "description": "The work-agent protocol for an issue whose xBRIEF plan has parallel waves. The foreman is the issue's work agent: it dispatches same-family workers as in-harness subagents in worktrees and cross-family workers as terminal-backend panes via `pan spawn`, has every worker commit on its own item branch and hand back, integrates each item onto the feature branch and runs `pan task done` for it, and runs `pan done` once at the end.",
